---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Joki Coding | Jasa Bantu Coding Web, App & API Development"
	description="Joki coding untuk mahasiswa dan profesional — web development, app development, API integration, and bug fixing by expert developers. Fast turnaround and clean code."
	lang="en"
>
	<section class="service-page">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Joki Coding</h1>
			<p class="service-lead">
				Need help with coding assignments or projects? Get expert assistance for web development, app development, API integration, and bug fixing — delivered by experienced developers who write clean, efficient code.
			</p>
			<div class="service-content">
				<h2>What We Cover</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>Web Development (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Next.js)</li>
					<li>Mobile App Development (Flutter, Kotlin, Swift)</li>
					<li>API Development &amp; Integration (REST API, GraphQL)</li>
					<li>Backend Development (Node.js, Express, Spring Boot)</li>
					<li>Database Implementation (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB)</li>
					<li>Bug Fixing &amp; Code Debugging</li>
					<li>Code Review &amp; Refactoring</li>
					<li>Assignment &amp; Project Completion</li>
				</ul>
				<h2>Why Choose Us</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>Expert developers with real-world coding experience</li>
					<li>Clean, well-structured, and documented code</li>
					<li>Fast turnaround — rush orders available</li>
					<li>Affordable rates for students and professionals</li>
					<li>Free consultation before starting</li>
				</ul>
				<h2>How It Works</h2>
				<ol>
					<li>Share your coding task or project details</li>
					<li>Get a free quote and estimated timeline</li>
					<li>We write the code and deliver the solution</li>
					<li>Review and request revisions if needed</li>
				</ol>
				<p class="cta-text">
					Ready to get help? <a href="/#contact">Contact us</a> for a free consultation.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
